{"Title":"An Act relative to the financial statement review and financial statement audit thresholds for Massachusetts public charities","BillNumber":"S910","DocketNumber":"SD792","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MDB0","Name":"Michael D. Brady","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MDB0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T16:20:36.91"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MDB0","Name":"Michael D. Brady","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MDB0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T16:20:36.91"},{"Id":"PMO","Name":"Patrick M. O'Connor","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PMO","ResponseDate":"2024-01-25T12:55:24.9633333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S910/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Brady, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 910) of Michael D. Brady for legislation relative to the financial statement review and financial statement audit thresholds for Massachusetts public charities.  The Judiciary.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1: Section 8F of Chapter 12 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out, in line 8, the figure: $200,000, and inserting in place thereof the following figure: $500,000, and further by striking out, in line 15, the figure: $500,00, and inserting in place thereof the following figure: $750,000.\r\n\tSECTION 2: Section 8F of Chapter 12, as so appearing, is hereby amended by inserting after paragraph 2, the following paragraph:\r\n\tShould the federal government increase the revenue thresholds for financial statement reviews or for financial statement audits after the enactment of this statute, the Massachusetts revenue thresholds for such will conform to the federal thresholds in effect.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Discharge to Another Committee","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J19","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J11","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J11"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}